-usage : on te dit tout sur ce classique indétrônable qui hydrate les levres depuis 1870.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"datePublished\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-03-29\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"dateModified\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-03-29\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/vaseline-baume-levres-pot-best-seller-avis-2026.svg\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/vaseline-baume-levres-pot-best-seller-avis-2026\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ImageObject\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/icon.svg\\\\\\\"}}}\\\"}}],null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Accueil\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Beauté\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/categorie/beaute\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":3,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Vaseline baume a levres en pot : pourquoi ce best-seller a 150 ans marche toujours aussi bien\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Le\\\",null,{\\\"activePag